              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) Phosphoric acid "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "(  H _3 PO _4 )"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " , used to make phosphate fertiliser and detergents."
